# t19-office-engine: parts of three fragments that touch HOT files (the in-crate parts are applied)

## native/core/Cargo.lock
Package `mixdog-office`: dependencies mixdog-core-api, mixdog-xlsx-formula added to its manifest (mixdog-fonts, mixdog-office-author, mixdog-pdf, mixdog-raster were already there). Regenerate offline.

## native/core/crates/mixdog-workspace-hack
Run the hakari check after the manifest edit; no new external crate.

