## The composer of the office-com transport (compose*.rs, wherever OfficeComConfig::new is called for the daemon)
A composer that runs inside another binary than mixdogd must set `config.rust_host_program` to the mixdogd path: a docx call starts
`<rust_host_program> office-com-host [--session] --data-dir <dir>`.
